   E China Normal Univ, State Key Lab Estuarine \& Coastal Res, Shanghai 200062, Peoples R China.
   E China Normal Univ, Dept Geog, Shanghai 200062, Peoples R China.
   Univ Salford, Sch Environm \& Life Sci, Res Inst Built \& Human Environm, Ctr Environm Syst Res, Gt Manchester M6 6PU, England.
   Montclair State Univ, Dept Earth \& Environm Studies, Montclair, NJ 07043 USA.},
DOI = {10.1016/j.envpol.2006.08.003},
ISSN = {0269-7491},
